# Entry Main: an ordinary reference place is built as before: `@: p 0` is the null reference named p (the book,
# #operand-storage). It is a reference cell, another form than the record of `return: @`. The launch runs to its end:
# the write through node\D\witness stands, D\witness 1.
D:
    int: witness 0
end: D
@: p 0
---
Main:
    node\D\witness := 1
